**Host honesty:** product binary is post-T1 tip (`1f67f4d`, 937592 B). Live `strings`
shows `c_guard_scan_idents`. Source has dlopen/ffi_call in both token scan
(`c_emit_secret.oo:253–255`) and emit guard (`c_emit_secret_guard.oo` net/FFI block).
Prior `t1_memory.oot` M-SG7 “no tcp_write/dlopen branches” is **stale vs this host**.

